[31;1m430:   deck:"Every week, three forecasters pick five stocks out of nearly 2,000 Taiwanese securities. Nothing is actually bought: the lab simulates, archives every step with a real timestamp and measures against chance. This page shows what it has produced so far, limits included.",[0m
