[31;1m435:   verdict:(v)=>`Over the ${v.w} simulated weeks (May–September 2026) no portfolio makes money net of costs in either scenario. Under the standard protocol, Q0 and Q1 ${v.stdBelow?"end below":"do not clearly beat"} the random control (${v.q0s} and ${v.q1s} vs. ${v.a1s} weekly)${v.user?`; with your capital, Q1 ${v.q1AboveUser?"ends slightly above chance":"does not beat chance either"} (${v.q1u} vs. ${v.a1u}), but the confidence interval of the excess includes zero`:""}. With so few weeks and no dividends we can neither claim nor rule out that they carry signal. The lists on this page are the output of an experiment, not recommendations.`,[0m
